#: src/netcross_report/html_report.py
msgid ""
"Chaque message SIP de l'appel, point de capture par point (date en ms depuis "
"le debut de l'appel). ABSENT : vu a un autre point mais pas a celui-ci. "
"Retransmis : vu plusieurs fois au meme point. Reecrit : SDP, premier Via ou "
"Contact differents du premier point ou le message a ete vu (ALG, SBC ; un "
"proxy ajoute aussi son propre Via). Les 100 Trying, produits a chaque saut, "
"ne sont jamais declares perdus."
msgstr ""
"Each SIP message of the call, capture point by capture point (time in ms "
"since the start of the call). MISSING: seen at another point but not at this "
"one. Retransmitted: seen several times at the same point. Rewritten: SDP, "
"first Via or Contact different from the first point where the message was "
"seen (ALG, SBC; a proxy also adds its own Via). 100 Trying responses, "
"produced at each hop, are never reported as lost."

