msgid ""
"Echange des flux principaux, NON TRONQUE : defilez et zoomez dans le temps. "
"Chaque fleche est un paquet vu a un point de capture ; le meme paquet vu a "
"deux points donne deux fleches, et leur ecart vertical mesure le temps de "
"transit."
msgstr ""
"Main flows' exchange, NOT TRUNCATED: scroll and zoom in time. Each arrow is\n"
"a packet seen at one capture point; the same packet seen at two points "
"gives\n"
"two arrows, and their vertical gap measures transit time."

